I. "Price level is independent of the quantity of money." This is incorrect because the Quantity Theory of Money clearly states that the price level is directly dependent on the quantity of money.

J. "Quantity of money variations are directly dependent upon changes in the price level." This is incorrect because the Quantity Theory of Money suggests that changes in the quantity of money have a direct impact on the price level, not the other way around.

